      "symbol": "wave.3.right",
      "description": {
        "en": "Hold your phone’s NFC sensing area near the mark on the lower front of the remote. The factory feature supports tap-to-cast with compatible devices.",
        "zh": "将手机的 NFC 感应区域靠近机身正面下方的标记。原厂用途是与兼容设备一碰投屏。"
      },
      "status": {
        "en": "Hardware present · Not integrated with Infinite Remote",
        "zh": "硬件具备 · 无限遥控器未接入"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "microphone",
      "name": {
        "en": "Microphone",
        "zh": "机身麦克风"
      },
      "symbol": "mic",
      "description": {
        "en": "The remote has a built-in microphone. The voice button can trigger ChatGPT’s dictation shortcut; Infinite Remote does not currently capture audio from the remote itself.",
        "zh": "遥控器具备独立的麦克风。语音键可触发 ChatGPT 的听写快捷键，无限遥控器当前未采集遥控器自身的音频。"
      },
      "status": {
        "en": "Hardware present · Not integrated with Infinite Remote",
        "zh": "硬件具备 · 无限遥控器未接入"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "usb-c",
      "name": {
        "en": "USB-C charging",
        "zh": "USB-C 充电"
      },
      "symbol": "bolt",
      "description": {
        "en": "Charge the remote through its USB-C port.",
        "zh": "通过机身的 USB-C 接口为遥控器充电。"
      },
      "status": {
        "en": "Hardware present · On-device charging",
        "zh": "硬件具备 · 机身充电"
      }
    }
  ],
  "release": "1.0.0",
  "summary": {
    "zh": "已适配的蓝牙遥控器，可用于应用切换、媒体选择和常用 Mac 操作。",
